{"id":"fd30fbde88ab93eb","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-lob-theorem.md","title":"Löb's Theorem","display":"thm-lob-theorem — Löb's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-lob-theorem","aliases":["92-thm-lob-theorem"],"display":"thm-lob-theorem — Löb's Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-lob-sentence]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-lem-derivability-conditions]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-lob-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-lob-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lob-theorem — Löb's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71758b63b2ee2736\" href=\"?note=71758b63b2ee2736\" title=\"92-df-lob-sentence\">92-df-lob-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c268cc9a199d00a\" href=\"?note=5c268cc9a199d00a\" title=\"92-lem-derivability-conditions\">92-lem-derivability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (standard internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\nG\\vdash(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi)\n\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\nG\\vdash(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi)\n\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\)</span> : “如果<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>”</li>\n<li>Löb定理：如果系统证明这个蕴涵，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>本身可证</li>\n<li>外层<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Longrightarrow\">\\(\\Longrightarrow\\)</span>连接两个元语言可导性判断；内层<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span>才是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>公式中的蕴涵符号</li>\n<li>结论依赖标准可证性谓词满足Hilbert–Bernays–Löb可推导条件</li>\n<li>Henkin问题的解答：Henkin句子可证</li>\n<li>这是可证性逻辑GL的核心公理来源</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-lob-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"71758b63b2ee2736","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-lob-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"5c268cc9a1